  subdivision 31 client
    error 1 Rejection
      description  A worker rejects a run a controller sends it; the controller prints the rejection after its own code, ↯/f.31.7.2
      source src/client/fume.Worker.scala
      variant 1 Digest
        description  the bytes sent for a classpath entry do not have its digest
      variant 2 Missing
        description  classpath entries the worker needs are never received
      variant 3 NoStore
        description  the worker has no blob store to hold the classpath in
    error 2 NoMachine
      description  The machine a run is sent to is neither on the swarm nor declared
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 3 NoSuites
      description  No test suites are found on the classpath
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 4 Incompatible
      description  Suites are built against a Soundness whose test events fume cannot read
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
      variant 1 Classpath
        description  the classpath's event schema is not fume's, so its suites are run the legacy way
      variant 2 Suite
        description  a suite a worker runs has an event schema which is not fume's, so its events cannot be read
    error 5 Consumer
      description  The consumer of a suite's test events fails while the suite runs
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
      variant 1 Worker
        description  the worker's event consumer fails
      variant 2 Local
        description  fume's own event consumer fails, and the suite is stopped; it carries the code of the error the consumer threw, if it has one
    error 6 Unstreamable
      description  A suite sent to a worker cannot stream its test events, so the worker does not run it
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 7 Remote
      description  A run on another machine ends before it is finished
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
      variant 1 Lost
        description  the connection to the worker is lost
      variant 2 Rejected
        description  the worker rejects the run, for a reason which carries its own code, ↯/f.31.1
    error 8 Connection
      description  A connection to a worker cannot be made; it carries the code of Pyrocosm's Peer.Error for the reason, ↯/f.31.8/f.8.1.3
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 9 TimedOut
      description  A run does not finish within its --timeout
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 10 NoClasspath
      description  No --classpath is specified
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 11 Identity
      description  This machine's identity cannot be created for `fume listen`
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 12 Unimplemented
      description  A subcommand is not yet implemented
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
    error 13 Uninvocable
      description  A suite cannot be invoked in a JVM of its own
      source src/client/fume_client.scala
